  "description": "Minsu and Sohee ended up sharing accommodations with an unfamiliar couple due to overlapping room reservations at their travel destination. On a night isolated by heavy rain, a card game is played at a drinking session, and the level of punishment increases, heightening the tension. The serious atmosphere and the alcohol combined led to the eventual crossing the forbidden line of a marital exchange...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/9200), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14284302), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5700001089), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079255)",
